        "body": "### Summary\r\n\r\nUpdated the Logger Class to manage the relationships between its variables with a networkx graph.\r\nUpdated derivative_functions in the backend object and functions in derivative_function.py to accept the Logger Class. (This is needed so that the jacobian evaluations can also be recorded.)\r\nAdded jacobian evaluations to the final output of results dictionary.\r\n\r\n### Details and Comments\r\n\r\nThese changes should fix issue. #11 ",
